+        Layout per sample (F latent frames, boundary b):
+            A  context noise:   frames < b get sigma_c ~ U(0, context_noise_max) w.p. context_noise_prob, else 0
+            B  monotone target: frames >= b get sigma_i non-decreasing from sigma_c to the sampled sigma
+                                w.p. monotone_target_prob, else all equal to sigma (unchanged behaviour)
+            B' full monotone:   within B, w.p. full_monotone_prob the prefix ramps 0 -> sigma_c as well
+        Loss masks are untouched (prefix stays excluded). Samples the prefix condition skipped keep their tensors.
+        """
